==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Aldebaran|Aldebaran]] is usually the 14th brightest star in the night sky, located in the zodiac constellation of Taurus. Taurus's name is Latin for "the Bull", hence why Aldebaran's [[Treasure]] and appearance on the map are bulls.
*The bull on the map appears to have three spikes running down the middle of its forehead, referencing [[wikia:saintseiya:Taurus Aldebaran|Taurus Aldebaran]] from ''[[wikipedia:Saint Seiya|Saint Seiya]]''.

